<#
.SYNOPSIS
    This PowerShell script remediates [Internet Explorer must be disabled for Windows 11].

.DESCRIPTION
 Internet Explorer 11 (IE11) is not supported on Windows 11 semi-annual channel.
  [STIG-ID: WN11-CC-000391].

